# Field table: Nasdaq TotalView-ITCH 5.0 (public specification "Nasdaq
# TotalView-ITCH 5.0", revision of April 28, 2023). Nasdaq, BX and PSX publish
# the same format. Page numbers are PDF pages (they match the printed "PAGE n"
# footers on pages 1-34). Offsets are 0-based within the message.
#
# Every message is preceded by a 2-byte big-endian length that excludes itself:
# the MoldUDP64 message-block length (MoldUDP64 V1.00 p.4), and the same in
# Nasdaq's sample files. It is not in the spec's tables. Over SoupBinTCP the
# message is the payload of a Sequenced Data packet and has no such prefix;
# glimpse50.tbl is that framing.
#
# Integers are unsigned big-endian; Alpha is ASCII, left justified, padded on
# the right with spaces; Price(4) and Price(8) are integers with 4 and 8 implied
# decimal places; timestamps are nanoseconds since midnight (p.4, Data Types).
@venue nasdaq
@endian big
@pad space
@type Integer uint
@type Price4 uint
@type Price8 uint
@type Alpha char

### itch::from_nasdaq
@length_prefix 2 exclusive

MessageType S 0 1 # SystemEvent: market or feed handler event (ITCH 5.0, 1.1, p.4)
@size 12
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Always 0
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
EventCode Alpha 11 1 # O start of messages, S start of system hours, Q start of market hours, M end of market hours, E end of system hours, C end of messages (p.5)

MessageType R 0 1 # StockDirectory: one per active symbol at start of day (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.1, pp.5-8)
@size 39
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code assigned to the symbol for the day
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
MarketCategory Alpha 19 1 # Q G S Nasdaq tiers; N NYSE, A NYSE American, P NYSE Arca, Z BATS Z, V IEX; space not available
FinancialStatusIndicator Alpha 20 1 # D E Q S G H J K C N (Nasdaq-listed); space not available
RoundLotSize Integer 21 4 # Shares in a round lot
RoundLotsOnly Alpha 25 1 # Y only round lots accepted, N no size restriction
IssueClassification Alpha 26 1 # Appendix D (p.34)
IssueSubType Alpha 27 2 # Appendix E (pp.35-36)
Authenticity Alpha 29 1 # P live/production, T test
ShortSaleThresholdIndicator Alpha 30 1 # Y restricted under Rule 203(b)(3), N not, space not available
IPOFlag Alpha 31 1 # Y set up as new IPO, N not, space not available
LULDReferencePriceTier Alpha 32 1 # 1 Tier 1, 2 Tier 2, space not available
ETPFlag Alpha 33 1 # Y ETP, N not, space not available
ETPLeverageFactor Integer 34 4 # Integral leverage of the ETP, rounded down
InverseIndicator Alpha 38 1 # Y inverse ETP, N not

MessageType H 0 1 # StockTradingAction: trading state of a security (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.2, p.8)
@size 25
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
TradingState Alpha 19 1 # H halted all US markets, P paused (Nasdaq-listed), Q quotation only, T trading on Nasdaq
Reserved Alpha 20 1 # Reserved
Reason Alpha 21 4 # Trading action reason code, Appendix C (pp.32-33)

MessageType Y 0 1 # RegSHORestriction: Reg SHO short sale price test status (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.3, p.9)
@size 20
LocateCode Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security (the spec names this field Locate Code)
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
RegSHOAction Alpha 19 1 # 0 no price test, 1 restriction in effect (intraday drop), 2 restriction remains in effect

MessageType L 0 1 # MarketParticipantPosition: market maker status in an issue (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.4, pp.9-10)
@size 26
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
MPID Alpha 11 4 # Market participant identifier
Stock Alpha 15 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
PrimaryMarketMaker Alpha 23 1 # Y primary market maker, N not
MarketMakerMode Alpha 24 1 # N normal, P passive, S syndicate, R pre-syndicate, L penalty
MarketParticipantState Alpha 25 1 # A active, E excused/withdrawn, W withdrawn, S suspended, D deleted

MessageType V 0 1 # MWCBDeclineLevel: market-wide circuit breaker levels for the day (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.5.1, p.10)
@size 35
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Always 0
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Level1 Price8 11 8 # MWCB level 1, Price(8)
Level2 Price8 19 8 # MWCB level 2, Price(8)
Level3 Price8 27 8 # MWCB level 3, Price(8)

MessageType W 0 1 # MWCBStatus: a circuit breaker level was breached (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.5.2, pp.10-11; the table is headed "MWCB Decline Level Message")
@size 12
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Always 0
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
BreachedLevel Alpha 11 1 # 1, 2 or 3

MessageType K 0 1 # IPOQuotingPeriodUpdate: anticipated IPO quotation release time (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.6, p.11)
@size 28
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # The spec says always 0
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
IPOQuotationReleaseTime Integer 19 4 # Seconds since midnight; 0 when cancelled or postponed
IPOQuotationReleaseQualifier Alpha 23 1 # A anticipated release time, C release cancelled/postponed
IPOPrice Price4 24 4 # IPO price, Price(4); 0 when cancelled or postponed

MessageType J 0 1 # LULDAuctionCollar: reopening auction collars after a LULD pause (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.7, pp.11-12)
@size 35
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
AuctionCollarReferencePrice Price4 19 4 # Reference price for the collars, Price(4)
UpperAuctionCollarPrice Price4 23 4 # Upper collar, Price(4)
LowerAuctionCollarPrice Price4 27 4 # Lower collar, Price(4)
AuctionCollarExtension Integer 31 4 # Number of extensions of the reopening auction

MessageType h 0 1 # OperationalHalt: operational halt on one Nasdaq market centre (ITCH 5.0, 1.2.8, p.12)
@size 21
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
MarketCode Alpha 19 1 # Q Nasdaq, B BX, X PSX
OperationalHaltAction Alpha 20 1 # H operationally halted, T halt lifted

MessageType A 0 1 # AddOrder: new displayed order without MPID attribution (ITCH 5.0, 1.3.1, p.13)
@size 36
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # Unique for the day
BuySellIndicator Alpha 19 1 # B buy, S sell
Shares Integer 20 4 # Displayed quantity
Stock Alpha 24 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
Price Price4 32 4 # Display price, Price(4)

MessageType F 0 1 # AddOrderMPID: new displayed order with MPID attribution (ITCH 5.0, 1.3.2, p.13)
@size 40
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # Unique for the day
BuySellIndicator Alpha 19 1 # B buy, S sell
Shares Integer 20 4 # Displayed quantity
Stock Alpha 24 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
Price Price4 32 4 # Display price, Price(4)
Attribution Alpha 36 4 # MPID of the entering participant

MessageType E 0 1 # OrderExecuted: part or all of a resting order executed at its display price (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.1, p.14)
@size 31
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The resting order executed
ExecutedShares Integer 19 4 # Shares executed; subtract from the order's displayed shares
MatchNumber Integer 23 8 # Unique for the day; referenced by BrokenTrade

MessageType C 0 1 # OrderExecutedWithPrice: resting order executed at a price other than its display price (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.2, pp.14-15)
@size 36
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The resting order executed
ExecutedShares Integer 19 4 # Shares executed; subtract from the order's displayed shares
MatchNumber Integer 23 8 # Unique for the day; referenced by BrokenTrade
Printable Alpha 31 1 # N non-printable (counted in a later bulk print), Y printable
ExecutionPrice Price4 32 4 # Execution price, Price(4)

MessageType X 0 1 # OrderCancel: part of a resting order cancelled (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.3, p.15)
@size 23
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order reduced
CancelledShares Integer 19 4 # Shares removed from the displayed size

MessageType D 0 1 # OrderDelete: a resting order removed in full (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.4, p.15)
@size 19
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order deleted

MessageType U 0 1 # OrderReplace: order cancel-replaced under a new reference number; side, symbol and MPID carry over (ITCH 5.0, 1.4.5, pp.15-16)
@size 35
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OriginalOrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # The order replaced; remove it
NewOrderReferenceNumber Integer 19 8 # Reference used for all later updates
Shares Integer 27 4 # New displayed quantity
Price Price4 31 4 # New display price, Price(4)

MessageType P 0 1 # Trade: execution of a non-displayed order; no book effect (ITCH 5.0, 1.5.1, pp.16-17)
@size 44
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
OrderReferenceNumber Integer 11 8 # Zero since December 6, 2010
BuySellIndicator Alpha 19 1 # Always B since 07/14/2014, whatever the resting side
Shares Integer 20 4 # Shares matched
Stock Alpha 24 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
Price Price4 32 4 # Match price, Price(4)
MatchNumber Integer 36 8 # Referenced by BrokenTrade

MessageType Q 0 1 # CrossTrade: bulk print of a cross (ITCH 5.0, 1.5.2, p.17; the table is headed "Trade Message (Non-Cross)")
@size 40
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Shares Integer 11 8 # Shares matched in the cross; may be 0
Stock Alpha 19 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
CrossPrice Price4 27 4 # Cross price, Price(4)
MatchNumber Integer 31 8 # Unique for the day
CrossType Alpha 39 1 # O opening, C closing, H IPO and halted/paused

MessageType B 0 1 # BrokenTrade: an execution was broken; no book effect (ITCH 5.0, 1.5.3, p.18)
@size 19
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
MatchNumber Integer 11 8 # Match number of an earlier E, C or P

MessageType I 0 1 # NOII: net order imbalance indicator before a cross (ITCH 5.0, 1.6, pp.18-19)
@size 50
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
PairedShares Integer 11 8 # Shares matchable at the current reference price
ImbalanceShares Integer 19 8 # Shares not paired at the current reference price
ImbalanceDirection Alpha 27 1 # B buy, S sell, N none, O insufficient orders, P paused
Stock Alpha 28 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
FarPrice Price4 36 4 # Clearing price for cross orders only, Price(4)
NearPrice Price4 40 4 # Clearing price for cross and continuous orders, Price(4)
CurrentReferencePrice Price4 44 4 # Price at which the shares are calculated, Price(4)
CrossType Alpha 48 1 # O opening, C closing, H IPO and halted/paused, A extended trading close
PriceVariationIndicator Alpha 49 1 # L <1%, 1-9, A 10-19.99%, B 20-29.99%, C >=30%, space not calculable

MessageType N 0 1 # RPII: retail price improvement interest (ITCH 5.0, 1.7, pp.19-20; greyed out in the PDF)
@size 20
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
InterestFlag Alpha 19 1 # B buy side, S sell side, A both, N none

MessageType O 0 1 # DLCRPriceDiscovery: direct listing with capital raise price discovery (ITCH 5.0, 1.8, p.20)
@size 48
StockLocate Integer 1 2 # Locate code identifying the security
TrackingNumber Integer 3 2 # Nasdaq internal tracking number
Timestamp Integer 5 6 # Nanoseconds since midnight
Stock Alpha 11 8 # Symbol, right-padded with spaces
OpenEligibilityStatus Alpha 19 1 # N not eligible, Y eligible for release
MinimumAllowablePrice Price4 20 4 # 20% below registration statement lower price, Price(4)
MaximumAllowablePrice Price4 24 4 # 80% above registration statement highest price, Price(4)
NearExecutionPrice Price4 28 4 # Reference price when the volatility test passed, Price(4)
NearExecutionTime Integer 32 8 # Time the near execution price was set; unit not stated
LowerPriceRangeCollar Price4 40 4 # 10% below the near execution price, Price(4)
UpperPriceRangeCollar Price4 44 4 # 10% above the near execution price, Price(4)

### end
